<title>CHINA: Jilin Chemical opens new ethylene line.</title>
<headline>Jilin Chemical opens new ethylene line.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jilin Chemical has opened a new ethylene production line with an annual capacity of 300,000 tonnes, the Xinhua news agency said in an overnight report.</p>
<p>Jilin Chemical imported equipment and technology from the Linde Company of Germany, South Korea's Samsung Group and from U.S. and Japanese firms, Xinhua said.</p>
<p>Construction work on the 19 billion yuan ($2.7 billion) project began in November 1993.</p>
<p>When the project is fully completed in 1997, it will be able to produce 1.3 million tonnes a year of synthetic resin, synthetic rubber and other chemical products, with total annual sales expected to top 8 billion yuan, Xinhua said.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
</text>
